  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added job cancellation support via IJobExecutor.TryCancel(jobId).\n            Fixed cancelled jobs being incorrectly reported as \"Invalid input type\" errors.\n            Added Store.RequeueAsync(jobId) API for restarting an existing job without creating a new job record.\n            Added RequeueAsync support to StoreBase and InMemoryStore.\n            Retry operations now requeue the existing job instead of creating a new job with a new identifier.\n            Requeued jobs preserve their identity, history, logs, and results.\n            Added automated tests for cancellation and requeue functionality.\n            Improved job monitoring experience by keeping retries within the same job instance.",
